-- Populate Draenor (map 1116) with creature spawns. integ_world shipped with only 5 creatures on the
-- WoD continent (the GOs/nodes were present but NPCs/mobs were stripped during consolidation), leaving
-- Frostfire Ridge / Shadowmoon / Gorgrond / Talador / Spires / Nagrand empty. These 39,299 spawns are
-- imported from a full-Draenor world DB (wowc_world), filtered to entries that exist in our
-- creature_template, with fresh guids in the 50000001+ range (integ's own spawns end ~12,000,357).
-- creature_addon was not imported (cosmetic auras/mounts only); can be layered later.
DELETE FROM `creature` WHERE `guid` BETWEEN 50000001 AND 50100000 AND `map` = 1116;

